# Keep host build artifacts out of the image. node_modules is the critical one:
# host (macOS) sharp/ffmpeg/prisma binaries would break the linux runtime.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.output
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.vercel
.git
.github
# Extension is not part of the web deploy; its source rides along harmlessly but
# its build output should not.
apps/extension/.output
# Never bake secrets into the image; Fly injects them as runtime secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
docs/qa/evidence
